        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Baskonia, Sabadell, Sevilla Atlético, Plus Ultra, Atl. Baleares, Cartagena, Real Jaén, Sevilla FC\n- Events: 1962–63 Segunda División, relegation to Tercera División\n- Places: Viejo Nervión\n- Concepts: reserve teams\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1962–63 Segunda División, Baskonia, Sabadell, Sevilla Atlético, Plus Ultra, Atl. Baleares, Cartagena, and Real Jaén were participants mentioned in the competition context.\n- In the 1962–63 Segunda División, Atl. Baleares, Cartagena, and Real Jaén were relegated to Tercera División.\n- Sevilla Atlético was founded in 1958.\n- Sevilla Atlético is the reserve team of Sevilla FC.\n- Sevilla Atlético plays in Segunda División.\n- Sevilla Atlético holds its home games at Viejo Nervión, which has a capacity of 7,500 seats.",
